> I use whatever we have on hand but we love a strawberry, pineapple and mango combo

Add @frozen fruit of choice{3%cups} and @coconut milk{4%tablespoons} to your #blender{} or #food processor{} and blend until smooth. You will need to scrape down the sides of the food processor to get it to blend between pulses.

Serve immediately or store in freezer until ready to eat (thaw out for a couple of minutes before serving it from freezer).